ctrl+semicolon start,cut-right,cut-down,cut-left,cut-up,cut-left,cut-up,cut-left,cut-up,cut-left,cut-up,cut-left
# ctrl+semicolon start,set 860 440 200 200
Escape end
Return warp,click 1,end

shift+h cut-left
shift+j cut-down
shift+k cut-up
shift+l cut-right

h move-left,warp
j move-down,warp
k move-up,warp
l move-right,warp

alt+h move-left,move-left,warp
alt+j move-down,move-down,warp
alt+k move-up,move-up,warp
alt+l move-right,move-right,warp

ctrl+h move-left 0.50, warp
ctrl+j move-down 0.50, warp
ctrl+k move-up 0.50, warp
ctrl+l move-right 0.50, warp


q drag 1
